  "privacy": {
    "title": "Privacy Policy",
    "date": "Last updated: March 16, 2026",
    "section1Title": "1. Data We Collect",
    "section1Body": "Momentra collects your email address and name during account creation. Plans you create, your preferences, and AI interactions are stored on our servers during app usage.",
    "section2Title": "2. How We Use Your Data",
    "section2Body": "Your data is used solely to provide app services, personalize AI recommendations, and send notifications. Your data is not shared with third parties for marketing purposes.",
    "section3Title": "3. Data Storage & Security",
    "section3Body": "Your data is securely stored on Supabase infrastructure. All communications are protected with SSL/TLS encryption. Database access is restricted by Row Level Security (RLS) policies.",
    "section4Title": "4. Your GDPR Rights",
    "section4Body": "Under GDPR and Turkish KVKK (Law No. 6698), you have the following rights:\n\n• Right to access your personal data\n• Right to rectification of inaccurate data\n• Right to erasure (right to be forgotten)\n• Right to object to processing\n• Right to data portability\n• Right to object to automated decision-making including profiling\n\nYou can permanently delete your account and all data via Profile > Delete Account. Deletion is irreversible and removes all your plans, AI history, and profile information from our servers.",
    "section5Title": "5. Cookies & Tracking",
    "section5Body": "Momentra does not use cookies. In-app analytics data is collected anonymously and used only to improve service quality.",
    "section6Title": "6. Data Controller",
    "section6Body": "Data Controller: Momentra\nEmail: support@momentra.com\n\nYou can submit your GDPR requests to the email above. Requests will be responded to within 30 days."
  },
